  "date": "2026-10-17",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行：支持更多境外投资者投资中国市场",
  "title_en": "Central Bank: Supporting More Foreign Investors to Invest in China's Markets",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月16日，中国人民银行副行长陶玲在上海的一个财富管理论坛上表示，央行将支持更多类型的境外投资者在中国金融市场投资。他们可以买中国的股票、债券、黄金和期货等产品。",
      "en": "On October 16, Tao Ling, deputy governor of the People's Bank of China, said at a wealth management forum in Shanghai that the central bank will support more types of foreign investors in investing in China's financial markets. They can buy Chinese stocks, bonds, gold, futures and other products."
    },
    {
      "zh": "陶玲介绍，到2026年6月底，已经有1200家境外机构来到中国的银行间债券市场。境外投资者持有的中国债券大约有3.2万亿元，持有的中国股票大约有4.7万亿元。",
      "en": "Tao Ling said that by the end of June 2026, 1,200 foreign institutions had already entered China's interbank bond market. Foreign investors hold about 3.2 trillion yuan of Chinese bonds and about 4.7 trillion yuan of Chinese stocks."
    },
    {
      "zh": "她说，境外企业和机构拿到人民币以后，不仅要“愿意持有”，还要“能够长期持有”。所以，中国需要提供更多可以投资的人民币资产，也要提供管理风险的工具。",
      "en": "She said that after foreign companies and institutions get renminbi, they should not only be \"willing to hold\" it but also \"able to hold it for the long term.\" So China needs to offer more renminbi assets to invest in, and also provide tools for managing risk."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这些措施的目的是让人民币在国际上用得更多。如果更多境外资金来到中国市场，中国的金融市场会更开放，人民币也会变得更国际化。",
      "en": "The aim of these measures is to make the renminbi used more widely around the world. If more foreign money comes into China's markets, China's financial markets will become more open, and the renminbi will become more international."
    }
  ],
